  user_input {
    user_response: "You are a Senior Product Designer and Frontend Engineer.\n\nDesign and build a premium personal portfolio website for an Associate AI Engineer.\n\nThe website must be production-quality and built using:\n\n- Next.js 15\n- TypeScript\n- Tailwind CSS\n- Framer Motion\n- shadcn/ui\n\nThe website must be fully responsive and ready for deployment on Vercel.\n\n## Design Style\n\nCreate a premium, modern portfolio inspired by:\n\n- OpenAI\n- Anthropic\n- Vercel\n- Linear\n- Stripe\n\nDark mode only.\n\nDo NOT create a beginner portfolio.\n\nAvoid:\n\n- Skill bars\n- Typing animation\n- Matrix effects\n- Neon hacker theme\n- Particle backgrounds\n- Overuse of gradients\n\nThe design should focus on typography, whitespace, premium cards, subtle motion and clean layouts.\n\n## Sections\n\n1. Sticky Navbar\n2. Hero\n3. Professional Experience\n4. Featured AI Projects\n5. Technical Skills\n6. About\n7. Contact\n8. Footer\n\n## Hero\n\nLeft side:\n\nName:\nNivash R N\n\nTitle:\nAssociate AI Engineer\n\nHeadline:\nBuilding production-ready AI applications using LLMs, AI Agents, MCP and scalable backend systems.\n\nButtons:\n\nResume\n\nGitHub\n\nLinkedIn\n\nContact\n\nRight side:\n\nProfessional office image placeholder.\n\n## Professional Experience\n\nCompany:\n\nAstroVed Pvt. Ltd.\n\nRole:\n\nAssociate AI Engineer\n\nTimeline style.\n\n## Projects\n\nShow only these projects.\n\nAI-Powered Numerology Prediction Platform\n\nAI-Powered Astrology Services\n\nAI-Powered SEO Content Generation\n\nEach project should include:\n\nProblem\n\nSolution\n\nTech Stack\n\nMy Contribution\n\nProfessional card design.\n\n## Skills\n\nDisplay as beautiful technology pills grouped into:\n\nAI Engineering\n\nBackend\n\nDatabases\n\nFrontend\n\nDeveloper Tools\n\n## About\n\nProfessional career journey instead of biography.\n\n## Contact\n\nSimple and premium.\n\nGitHub\n\nLinkedIn\n\nEmail\n\nResume\n\n## Code Quality\n\nUse reusable components.\n\nUse TypeScript.\n\nNo inline styles.\n\nNo hardcoded data inside components.\n\nKeep all portfolio content in separate data files.\n\nProject structure:\n\nsrc/components\n\nsrc/data\n\nsrc/app\n\npublic/images\n\npublic/resume\n\nThe result should look like a premium AI Engineer portfolio that recruiters immediately recognize as production quality rather than a beginner template."
    items {
      text: "You are a Senior Product Designer and Frontend Engineer.\n\nDesign and build a premium personal portfolio website for an Associate AI Engineer.\n\nThe website must be production-quality and built using:\n\n- Next.js 15\n- TypeScript\n- Tailwind CSS\n- Framer Motion\n- shadcn/ui\n\nThe website must be fully responsive and ready for deployment on Vercel.\n\n## Design Style\n\nCreate a premium, modern portfolio inspired by:\n\n- OpenAI\n- Anthropic\n- Vercel\n- Linear\n- Stripe\n\nDark mode only.\n\nDo NOT create a beginner portfolio.\n\nAvoid:\n\n- Skill bars\n- Typing animation\n- Matrix effects\n- Neon hacker theme\n- Particle backgrounds\n- Overuse of gradients\n\nThe design should focus on typography, whitespace, premium cards, subtle motion and clean layouts.\n\n## Sections\n\n1. Sticky Navbar\n2. Hero\n3. Professional Experience\n4. Featured AI Projects\n5. Technical Skills\n6. About\n7. Contact\n8. Footer\n\n## Hero\n\nLeft side:\n\nName:\nNivash R N\n\nTitle:\nAssociate AI Engineer\n\nHeadline:\nBuilding production-ready AI applications using LLMs, AI Agents, MCP and scalable backend systems.\n\nButtons:\n\nResume\n\nGitHub\n\nLinkedIn\n\nContact\n\nRight side:\n\nProfessional office image placeholder.\n\n## Professional Experience\n\nCompany:\n\nAstroVed Pvt. Ltd.\n\nRole:\n\nAssociate AI Engineer\n\nTimeline style.\n\n## Projects\n\nShow only these projects.\n\nAI-Powered Numerology Prediction Platform\n\nAI-Powered Astrology Services\n\nAI-Powered SEO Content Generation\n\nEach project should include:\n\nProblem\n\nSolution\n\nTech Stack\n\nMy Contribution\n\nProfessional card design.\n\n## Skills\n\nDisplay as beautiful technology pills grouped into:\n\nAI Engineering\n\nBackend\n\nDatabases\n\nFrontend\n\nDeveloper Tools\n\n## About\n\nProfessional career journey instead of biography.\n\n## Contact\n\nSimple and premium.\n\nGitHub\n\nLinkedIn\n\nEmail\n\nResume\n\n## Code Quality\n\nUse reusable components.\n\nUse TypeScript.\n\nNo inline styles.\n\nNo hardcoded data inside components.\n\nKeep all portfolio content in separate data files.\n\nProject structure:\n\nsrc/components\n\nsrc/data\n\nsrc/app\n\npublic/images\n\npublic/resume\n\nThe result should look like a premium AI Engineer portfolio that recruiters immediately recognize as production quality rather than a beginner template."
    }
  }
}
